---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import VideoBg from "../components/VideoBg.astro";
---

<Layout title="FeatureCo">
  <Nav />
  <section class="hero feature">
    <div class="content__wrapper case"></div>
  </section>
  <section class="work">
    <div class="work_wrapper">
      <div class="work-title">
        <h2 class="h2">FEATURECO.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="work_details">
        <ul role="list" class="list-2 work w-list-unstyled">
          <li class="list-title work">
            <div>SERVICES</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">VISUAL DESIGN</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">COPYWRITING</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">BRANDING</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">PHOTOGRAPHY</div>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="work_intro">
          <p>A personal project that puts some of our favourite artists in the spotlight.<br><br>FeatureCo. is the small print company that fills a big gap in the market. By curating, printing and promoting independent artists around the world, we’re helping to support fairer compensation for this kind of artwork. <a href="https://www.wearefeature.co/" class="text-link">Vist site</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3646-d4edcd96" class="w-layout-layout work_grid wf-layout-layout">
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3647-d4edcd96" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/fco-hand.mp4" img="/images/work-1.webp" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/work-1-p-500.png 500w, /images/work-1-p-800.png 800w, /images/work-1-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/work-1.webp 1440w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3653-d4edcd96" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/yay-print_1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/yay-print_1yay-print.webp 500w, /images/yay-print_1yay-print.webp 800w, /images/yay-print_1yay-print.webp 1080w, /images/yay-print_1.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd365f-d4edcd96" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/fco-prints_1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/fco-prints_1fco-prints.webp 500w, /images/fco-prints_1fco-prints.webp 800w, /images/fco-prints_1fco-prints.webp 1080w, /images/fco-prints_1fco-prints.webp 1600w, /images/fco-prints_1fco-prints.webp 2000w, /images/fco-prints_1fco-prints.webp 2600w, /images/fco-prints_1.webp 3000w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_4c0fd7a6-7b1c-909c-2198-3305b8314673-d4edcd96" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/fco-banner.mp4" img="/images/banner.webp" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/banner-p-500.png 500w, /images/banner-p-800.png 800w, /images/banner-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/banner-p-1600.png 1600w, /images/banner-p-2000.png 2000w, /images/banner-p-2600.png 2600w, /images/banner.webp 3000w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3669-d4edcd96" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/fco-closeup_1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/fco-closeup_1fco-closeup.webp 500w, /images/fco-closeup_1fco-closeup.webp 800w, /images/fco-closeup_1fco-closeup.webp 1080w, /images/fco-closeup_1.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_4e46d753-55c9-db65-bd2c-6db41309ac57-d4edcd96" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/fco-feature.mp4" img="/images/work-1.webp" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/work-1-p-500.png 500w, /images/work-1-p-800.png 800w, /images/work-1-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/work-1.webp 1440w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3675-d4edcd96" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/fco-bernardo_1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/fco-bernardo_1fco-bernardo.webp 500w, /images/fco-bernardo_1fco-bernardo.webp 800w, /images/fco-bernardo_1fco-bernardo.webp 1080w, /images/fco-bernardo_1fco-bernardo.webp 1600w, /images/fco-bernardo_1fco-bernardo.webp 2000w, /images/fco-bernardo_1fco-bernardo.webp 2600w, /images/fco-bernardo_1.webp 3000w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_94f218bf-7c86-48a2-7318-804d19e60b76-d4edcd96" class="w-layout-cell">
          <div class="work_text">
            <p>FeatureCo. is different in the way that it shines a spotlight on each artist, as well as their work, so there’s a stronger connection between the two.<br><br>We’ve learned there’s always an interesting story behind each piece and keep every print 100% exclusive to FeatureCo., which means you won’t find them anywhere else.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_4de8a0e5-ab81-d579-9dee-b09df83eaf5c-d4edcd96" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/fco-cards_1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/fco-cards_1fco-cards.webp 500w, /images/fco-cards_1fco-cards.webp 800w, /images/fco-cards_1fco-cards.webp 1080w, /images/fco-cards_1.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd36ad-d4edcd96" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/fco-social.mp4" img="/images/video-large.webp" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/video-large-p-500.png 500w, /images/video-large-p-800.png 800w, /images/video-large-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/video-large-p-1600.png 1600w, /images/video-large-p-2000.png 2000w, /images/video-large-p-2600.png 2600w, /images/video-large.webp 3000w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd36b9-d4edcd96" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/fco-tubes_1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/fco-tubes_1fco-tubes.webp 500w, /images/fco-tubes_1fco-tubes.webp 800w, /images/fco-tubes_1fco-tubes.webp 1080w, /images/fco-tubes_1.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_1c629ea7-af3c-123e-4016-8d0d8b2eca1a-d4edcd96" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/fco-icons.mp4" img="/images/image-4.webp" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/image-4-p-500.png 500w, /images/image-4-p-800.png 800w, /images/image-4-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/image-4.webp 1440w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_6e8c68dc-cb6e-4a8b-42b0-0be80fe221b1-d4edcd96" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/fco-large_1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/fco-large_1fco-large.webp 500w, /images/fco-large_1fco-large.webp 800w, /images/fco-large_1fco-large.webp 1080w, /images/fco-large_1fco-large.webp 1600w, /images/fco-large_1fco-large.webp 2000w, /images/fco-large_1fco-large.webp 2600w, /images/fco-large_1.webp 3000w" alt=""></div>
      </div>
      <div id="footer-line" class="footer-trigger"></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
